{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"High-dimensional datasets frequently suffer from the “curse of dimensionality”—excessive noise, collinearity, high memory footprints, and difficulty in visualization. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftCluster","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides a suite of linear and non-linear dimensionality reduction algorithms optimized for Apple Silicon unified memory:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PCA"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Exact Principal Component Analysis using singular value decomposition (SVD) with automatic CPU and UMA GPU hardware routing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Ultra-fast approximate rank-$k$ matrix decomposition following the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm for massive datasets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/TSNE"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Non-linear manifold learning minimizing Kullback-Leibler divergence for 2D and 3D cluster visualization.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["graph TD","    HighDim[High-Dimensional Feature Matrix X: N x D] --> Choice{Decomposition Strategy}","    Choice -->|Linear Global Variance| PCA[PCA: SVD Decomposition]","    Choice -->|Massive Dense Matrix| RSVD[RandomizedSVD: Low-Rank Projection]","    Choice -->|Non-Linear Cluster Visualization| TSNE[t-SNE: Manifold Probabilities]","    PCA --> LowDimLinear[Reduced Feature Matrix: N x k]","    RSVD --> Factors[Low-Rank Factors: U, S, Vt]","    TSNE --> Vis2D[2D\/3D Embedding Coordinates]"],"syntax":"mermaid"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"1-Principal-Component-Analysis-PCA","text":"1. Principal Component Analysis (PCA)","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Principal Component Analysis finds orthogonal projection axes (principal components) that maximize the variance of the data.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Fitting-and-Transforming","text":"Fitting and Transforming","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize PCA to extract 3 principal components","let pca = PCA(nComponents: 3, device: .auto)","","\/\/ 2. Fit and project the data matrix [N rows x D columns]","let X_reduced = try await pca.fitTransform(featureMatrix)","","\/\/ 3. Inspect explained variance ratios","if let ratios = pca.explainedVarianceRatio {","    print(\"Explained variance per component: \\(ratios)\")","    let cumulative = ratios.reduce(0.0, +)","    print(\"Total captured variance: \\(String(format: \"%.2f%%\", cumulative * 100))\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Choosing-Optimal-Components-Scree-Analysis","text":"Choosing Optimal Components (Scree Analysis)","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analyze the cumulative variance to select the minimal number of components capturing $90%+$ of total data variance:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var cumulativeSum = 0.0","for (index, ratio) in (pca.explainedVarianceRatio ?? []).enumerated() {","    cumulativeSum += ratio","    print(\"PC\\(index + 1): \\(String(format: \"%.3f\", ratio)) | Cumulative: \\(String(format: \"%.1f%%\", cumulativeSum * 100))\")","    if cumulativeSum >= 0.90 {","        print(\">> Recommended cutoff: \\(index + 1) components\")","        break","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"2-Approximate-Low-Rank-SVD-RandomizedSVD","text":"2. Approximate Low-Rank SVD (`RandomizedSVD`)","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When factorizing large matrices where $k \\ll \\min(M, N)$, full deterministic LAPACK SVD ($O(M N \\cdot \\min(M, N))$) can be compute-intensive. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" computes an approximate rank-$k$ factorization $X \\approx U \\cdot \\text{diag}(S) \\cdot V^T$ with sketching cost $O(M N l (q + 1))$ where $l = \\min(\\min(M, N), k + p)$ (plus QR and small $l \\times N$ SVD); approximation quality depends on the matrix’s singular-value decay, oversampling ","type":"text"},{"code":"nOversamples","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and power iterations ","type":"text"},{"code":"nPowerIter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"):","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ Factorize a 10,000 x 500 matrix into top 20 singular components","let svdResult = try RandomizedSVD.compute(","    X: largeMatrix,","    nComponents: 20,","    nOversamples: 10,  \/\/ Oversampling p for stability","    nPowerIter: 2,     \/\/ Power iterations q for slow spectral decay","    seed: 42",")","","print(\"Left singular vectors U: [\\(svdResult.U.count) x \\(svdResult.U.first?.count ?? 0)]\")","print(\"Top singular values S: \\(svdResult.S.prefix(5))\")","print(\"Right singular vectors Vt: [\\(svdResult.Vt.count) x \\(svdResult.Vt.first?.count ?? 0)]\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"3-Non-Linear-Visualization-with-t-SNE","text":"3. Non-Linear Visualization with t-SNE","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"While PCA preserves global variance, t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding (t-SNE) preserves local neighborhood similarities, making it ideal for visualizing non-linear clusters, high-dimensional embeddings, and classification manifolds in 2D or 3D.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize t-SNE actor","let tsne = TSNE(","    nComponents: 2,","    perplexity: 30.0,","    learningRate: 200.0,","    maxIterations: 1000,","    seed: 42",")","","\/\/ 2. Perform non-linear embedding","let coordinates2D = try await tsne.fitTransform(featureMatrix)","","\/\/ 3. Inspect final optimization divergence","if let klLoss = await tsne.klDivergence {","    print(\"Final KL Divergence: \\(klLoss)\")","}","","\/\/ 4. Pass coordinates to SwiftVisualization for interactive scatter plots","for point in coordinates2D.prefix(5) {","    print(\"X: \\(point[0]), Y: \\(point[1])\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"4-Hardware-Routing--Device-Selection","text":"4. Hardware Routing & Device Selection","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PCA","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" accepts an ","type":"text"},{"code":"ExecutionDevice","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PreparedPCA","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for numerical precision and ownership details.","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Device mode","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Behavior","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".auto","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Uses the existing hardware router to choose a fitting device.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cpu"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uses Double Accelerate LAPACK or randomized SVD, according to the selected solver."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".gpu","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uses Float MLX conversion and centering, then SVD on the CPU stream."}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ane"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Uses the existing router fallback for unsupported ANE execution.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"thematicBreak"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PreparedPCA","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PCA","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/TSNE"],"anchor":"Dimensionality-Reduction","title":"Dimensionality Reduction"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Reduce high-dimensional feature spaces, uncover latent structures, and visualize complex datasets using PCA, Randomized SVD, and t-SNE.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","title":"Guides & Tutorials"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/dimensionalityreduction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Dimensionality Reduction & Manifold Learning","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/ClusteringAndOutliers":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","abstract":[{"text":"High-performance clustering and density-based anomaly detection powered by ","type":"text"},{"code":"KDTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DBSCAN"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KMeans"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"LocalOutlierFactor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"IsolationForest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"Spatial Indexing, Clustering & Outlier Detection","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/clusteringandoutliers"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/VectorStoreAndRAG":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Build low-latency semantic search, embedding retrieval, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines on Apple Silicon using SIMD Accelerate.","type":"text"}],"role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/vectorstoreandrag","title":"In-Memory VectorStore & On-Device RAG","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PCA Dimensionality Reduction & Unsupervised Clustering."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster","title":"SwiftCluster","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/PCA":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PCA","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PCA","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Principal component analysis with explicit CPU solver and device choices."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prepared inputs retain feature identity and return named, provenance-preserving scores."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PCA"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/pca","title":"PCA"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/RandomizedSVD":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomized Singular Value Decomposition using the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD","type":"topic","title":"RandomizedSVD","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomizedsvd"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/HNSWVectorSearch":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Scale approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) retrieval using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs with empirical logarithmic query scaling under navigable graph structure."}],"role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch","type":"topic","title":"High-Dimensional Vector Search with HNSW"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/TSNE":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TSNE"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/TSNE","abstract":[{"text":"t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding (t-SNE) for non-linear dimensionality reduction and manifold learning.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TSNE"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/tsne","title":"TSNE","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/PreparedPCA":{"abstract":[{"text":"Fit preprocessing on training observations, apply the fitted preprocessing to held-out observations, and pass prepared data directly to PCA. PCA returns component scores with feature names and original row positions.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/preparedpca","title":"Fit and project prepared data with PCA","role":"article","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/PreparedPCA","type":"topic"}}}